        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Brass Accents A06-K0400, Solid Brass Rope Trimmed Door Knocker</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis modestly sized Solid Brass 6-1/2 Inch English Rope Door Knocker is often referred to as being cast in the Georgian Style made popular in the mid 1700's. The basic rope design really stands out in any finish. The traditional design is great for historical homes and people who like the bold yet elegant design aesthetics of early America.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nBrass Accents provides distinctive craftsmanship with old-world tradition for a lifetime of elegance. Their products are hand finished in the USA. They are one of the world's leading crafters of cast-brass and hot-forged decorative brass hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Rope Trimmed 6-1/2 Door Knocker:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Height: 6-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Center: 4-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Solid Brass</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
